    {
      "order": 3,
      "_uid": "a6651b62-b97d-4f43-aa83-61874e7dfaba",
      "component": "page_bloks_content",
      "theme": "black",
      "heading": "Our process",
      "lead": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "People talk about Gladeye Magic."
        }
      ],
      "columns": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For us that means making digital experiences which create "
          },
          {
            "t": "i",
            "v": "emotional"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " connections between brands and people. "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Movement, surprise, wonder."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We bring brands to life through striking creativity and craft, taking people out of their everyday and into something more special."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For creative digital to be truly effective we must understand "
          },
          {
            "t": "i",
            "v": "who"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your brand is. And who your audience are, what they want, and what you want them to know, feel and do."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So our projects always begin with discovery and strategy, we call it our Think phase. "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We immerse ourselves in your world, understanding your most valuable and exciting points of difference"
          },
          {
            "t": "span",
            "v": "—",
            "color": "rgb(32, 33, 36)"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "then we amplify them in "
          },
          {
            "t": "a",
            "v": "incredible ways",
            "href": "/work/",
            "target": "_self",
            "linktype": "story"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Tell us what you want your brand to achieve in the world, say "
          },
          {
            "t": "a",
            "v": "hello@gladeye.com",
            "href": "mailto:hello@gladeye.com",
            "target": null,
            "linktype": "url"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ],
        []
      ],
